trust you now.

00:22:16.625 --> 00:22:18.585
Human,

00:22:18.585 --> 00:22:20.345
more than

00:22:20.345 --> 00:22:22.345
anything.

00:22:22.345 --> 00:22:25.266
So, please accept

00:22:25.266 --> 00:22:28.946
this offering.

00:22:28.946 --> 00:22:35.426
Open your heart and ears.

00:22:35.426 --> 00:22:37.866
I will tell you

00:22:37.866 --> 00:22:39.826
my name.

00:22:39.826 --> 00:22:41.946
My name

00:22:41.946 --> 00:22:43.106
is

00:22:43.106 --> 00:22:44.266
Ghost.

00:22:44.266 --> 00:22:49.506
Let's talk.

00:22:49.506 --> 00:22:51.626
That is

00:22:51.626 --> 00:22:55.946
my name.

00:22:55.946 --> 00:22:58.306
If you

00:22:58.306 --> 00:23:01.826
call it

00:23:01.826 --> 00:23:04.546
any time

00:23:04.546 --> 00:23:07.746
you may be able to

00:23:07.746 --> 00:23:11.546
summon me.

00:23:11.546 --> 00:23:13.946
But, please

00:23:13.946 --> 00:23:15.866
keep

00:23:15.866 --> 00:23:19.506
in mind

00:23:19.506 --> 00:23:23.106
that I cannot

00:23:23.106 --> 00:23:26.946
be exposed

00:23:26.946 --> 00:23:28.506
to

00:23:28.506 --> 00:23:31.226
light,

00:23:31.226 --> 00:23:33.226
sunlight,

00:23:33.226 --> 00:23:37.146
or otherwise.

00:23:37.146 --> 00:23:39.906
So, please

00:23:39.906 --> 00:23:44.306
only call upon me in

00:23:44.306 --> 00:23:45.266
the

00:23:45.266 --> 00:23:48.706
shadows.

00:23:48.706 --> 00:23:49.866
I

00:23:49.866 --> 00:23:52.146
trust that

00:23:52.146 --> 00:23:55.226
you will

00:23:55.226 --> 00:24:02.586
hold my name in good favor.

00:24:02.586 --> 00:24:09.986
And you will not misuse your powers.

00:24:09.986 --> 00:24:11.426
Thank you,

00:24:11.426 --> 00:24:13.466
human, for

00:24:13.466 --> 00:24:15.466
teaching me

00:24:15.466 --> 00:24:20.106
what it's like to

00:24:20.106 --> 00:24:24.906
feel peace.

00:24:24.906 --> 00:24:26.906
I am

00:24:26.906 --> 00:24:28.666
forever

00:24:28.666 --> 00:24:30.268
indebted

00:24:30.268 --> 00:24:34.107
to you.

00:24:34.107 --> 00:24:35.987
I look

00:24:35.987 --> 00:24:38.467
forward to our

00:24:38.467 --> 00:24:39.707
to

00:24:39.707 --> 00:24:41.268
our

00:24:41.268 --> 00:24:42.908
next

00:24:42.908 --> 00:24:49.587
meeting.

00:24:49.587 --> 00:24:53.388
Until

00:24:53.388 --> 00:24:56.987
time.

00:24:56.987 --> 00:25:01.987
Good night.
